sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant PostOwnerWS as WS Client (post owner)
    participant OtherWS as WS Client (other logged-in user)
    participant WSServer as graphql-ws (useServer)
    participant PS as PubSub
    participant HTTP as Apollo Server (HTTP)
    participant CDB as CommentSQLDataSource
    participant PostDB as PostSQLDataSource
    participant DB as MySQL

    PostOwnerWS->>WSServer: subscription { createdComment { ... } }
    WSServer->>WSServer: context({ req, connection: true })<br/>(no LoginApi over WS)
    WSServer->>PS: withFilter(...) →<br/>asyncIterableIterator(CREATED_COMMENT)
    Note over PostOwnerWS,PS: connection open, waiting

    OtherWS->>WSServer: subscription { createdComment { ... } }
    WSServer->>PS: asyncIterableIterator(CREATED_COMMENT)
    Note over OtherWS,PS: also waiting, different loggedUserId

    Note over HTTP,DB: Meanwhile, over HTTP
    HTTP->>HTTP: mutation createComment(postId, comment)
    HTTP->>HTTP: checkIsLoggedIn(loggedUserId)
    HTTP->>PostDB: getPost(postId)
    PostDB->>DB: SELECT ...
    PostDB-->>HTTP: { userId: postOwnerId }
    HTTP->>CDB: create({ postId, comment, userId, postOwner: postOwnerId })
    CDB->>DB: SELECT ... (duplicate check)
    CDB->>DB: INSERT INTO comments ...
    CDB->>PS: publish(CREATED_COMMENT,<br/>{ createdComment, postOwner: postOwnerId })

    PS-->>WSServer: payload delivered to every open iterator
    WSServer->>WSServer: filterFn(payload, ctx) per subscriber:<br/>payload.postOwner === ctx.loggedUserId ?

    alt PostOwnerWS.loggedUserId === postOwnerId
        WSServer-->>PostOwnerWS: createdComment (delivered)
    end
    Note over OtherWS: filterFn returns false — nothing delivered
